{"unit_id":"darkings__dsh-plugin-update-center#card-zh","repo":"darkings/dsh-plugin-update-center","commit":"63df281450031f6ffd1a4ab103aff8e32b4530ed","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-update-center 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的插件更新中心，在侧边栏提供更新入口与进度面板，并由 Host 路由调用 DSH 插件管理器处理 profile 插件。它检查 npm registry 中的稳定版本和 DSH/Node 兼容性，可选择并排队更新插件，保留启用状态，并在更新前创建 profile 快照、更新后核验安装结果，失败时尝试恢复旧版本。面板还可扫描并清理失效的插件选择和补丁引用。适合希望集中维护 DSH 插件的用户；需能访问 npm registry 或备用镜像，不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:4","index.js:90","lib/engine.js:98","lib/engine.js:496","lib/backup.js:43"]}
{"unit_id":"darkings__dsh-plugin-update-center#card-en","repo":"darkings/dsh-plugin-update-center","commit":"63df281450031f6ffd1a4ab103aff8e32b4530ed","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-update-center adds a DSH Web sidebar panel for profile plugin updates. It checks stable npm releases and runtime compatibility, queues updates, snapshots profile files, verifies installs, and attempts rollback after failures. It also finds dangling plugin references. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:4","index.js:90","lib/engine.js:98","lib/engine.js:496","lib/backup.js:43"]}
